<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>This Month in AI – </title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --clon-purple: #5B2D8B;
  --clon-purple-dark: #442165;
  --clon-teal: #2BB0E6;
  --clon-purple-light: #EDE7F6;
  --clon-teal-light: #E6F6FC;
  --bg: #F8FAFC;
  --text-dark: #0F172A;
  --text-muted: #475569;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}

/* CONTAINER */
.container {
  width: 600px;
  margin: 30px auto;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 14px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
}

/* HEADER */
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    var(--clon-purple),
    var(--clon-teal)
  );
  color: #ffffff;
  padding: 40px 32px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.header::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent);
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.header img {
  height: 48px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15));
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.header-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  flex: 1;
}

.header h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.header-subtitle {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  margin: 8px 0 0 0;
  opacity: 0.92;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  font-style: italic;
}

/* MAIN GRID */
.main {
  display: block;
}

/* LEFT CONTENT */
.left {
  padding: 22px;
}

.section-title {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: var(--clon-purple);
}

.ai-content p {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* DID YOU KNOW */
.did-you-know {
  margin-top: 0;
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    var(--clon-purple),
    var(--clon-purple-dark)
  );
  color: #ffffff;
}

.did-you-know h3 {
  margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.did-you-know p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

/* CARDS GRID */
.cards-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 22px;
}

/* DID YOU KNOW FULL WIDTH */
.did-you-know-full {
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding: 22px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    var(--clon-purple),
    var(--clon-purple-dark)
  );
  color: #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(91, 45, 139, 0.2);
}

.did-you-know-full h3 {
  margin-top: 0;
  font-size: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.did-you-know-full p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* SIDEBAR */
.sidebar {
  background: var(--carelon-teal-light);
  padding: 20px;
}

/* BUZZ WORDS */
.buzz {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--clon-purple);
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.buzz strong {
  color: var(--clon-purple);
}

.buzz ul {
  padding-left: 18px;
  margin: 10px 0 0;
}

.buzz li {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-dark);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

/* BUZZ WORDS TABLE */
.buzz-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.buzz-table tr:first-child td {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--clon-purple);
  padding: 8px 0;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--clon-purple-light);
}

.buzz-table td {
  padding: 10px 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
}

.buzz-table td:first-child {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--clon-purple);
  width: 45%;
}

.buzz-table td:last-child {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding-left: 10px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

/* LEARNING */
.learning {
  background: var(--clon-teal);
  color: #ffffff;
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.learning strong {
  font-size: 13px;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.learning small {
  opacity: 0.9;
  font-size: 10px;
}

/* KNOW TEAM */
.team {
  background: var(--clon-purple-light);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.team strong {
  font-size: 13px;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  color: var(--clon-purple);
}

.team p {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--clon-purple-dark);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

/* FOOTER */
.footer {
  background: #0F172A;
  color: #CBD5F5;
  padding: 14px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 12px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <!-- Replace src with your local Carelon logo if needed -->
    <img src="cgs_sm_h_rgb_c.png" alt="Logo">
    <div class="header-content">
      <h1>AI Unlocked Monthly Trends & Tools</h1>
      <p class="header-subtitle">Stay updated with our latest news and insights</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN -->
  <div class="main">

    <!-- LEFT -->
    <div class="left">

      <div class="section-title">This Month in AI</div>

      <div class="ai-content">
        <p>
          Ralph Wegman, an AI at Navy CMU lab, turned into a coding phenomenon.
          What started as a 5-line bash script in an Australian goat farm is now
          an official AI coding character.
        </p>

        <p>
          Instead of training from scratch, Ralph uses a clever “Stop Hook”
          that intercepts Claude when it thinks it’s done, validates the work,
          and forces retries if tests fail.
        </p>

        <p>
          Results are wild — a $500,000 contract completed for ~$397 in API costs.
        </p>

        <p>
          Early wins include solving month-long scientific problems in hours.
          Models now exceed 90% on PhD-level benchmarks.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is not replacing experts — but creating collaborators
          that accelerate discovery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="did-you-know">
          <h3>Did you know?</h3>
          <p>
            Humans often over-trust AI systems, which is why simple
            mistakes can go unnoticed in production workflows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="learning">
          <strong>Learning</strong><br>
          <small>Paper reading session – 45 mins</small>
        </div>

        <div class="team">
          <strong>Know your team</strong>
          <p>
            clon Analytics teams deliver AI-driven insights across
            healthcare, payment integrity, and clinical outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="buzz">
        <strong>Buzz Words</strong>
        <table class="buzz-table">
          <tr>
            <td>Term</td>
            <td>Definition</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>MCP</td>
            <td>Model Context Protocol – Framework for managing AI model inputs and outputs</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Vibe Coding</td>
            <td>Intuitive development guided by patterns and feel rather than strict rules</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>TPO</td>
            <td>Test-Driven Process Optimization – Testing-first AI development approach</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>PRM</td>
            <td>Process Reward Models – AI systems that evaluate reasoning processes</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Inference Scaling</td>
            <td>Using more compute during model inference to improve accuracy</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    © clon | Internal AI Newsletter
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
